s://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118876.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-27T17:08:32Z"},"body":"Closes #118871\r\nCloses #113566\r\nCurrently, a project with a lot of tags causes the project title text to clip and also pushes the sidebar beyond the Project Manager window size.\r\n<img width=\"866\" height=\"163\" alt=\"tag_unwrapped\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d39a8e82-0ce7-4c56-b7ab-63366d738e79\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nThis wraps the tags by having them inside an HFlowContainer instead of the default HBoxContainer.\r\n<img width=\"866\" height=\"193\" alt=\"tag_wrapped\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71a2ac0c-f8ee-4a1d-b6a5-ddb51793f913\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nIt also works properly with longer project titles\r\n<img width=\"711\" height=\"87\" alt=\"long_project_title\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d93e1e8-cf49-4aa3-96c4-5d55a663e8a0\" />\r\n\r\nEdit 1: This fix won't work for long tag names (or a combination of an overly long project title and tag name), though it is unlikely to encounter such an issue.\r\nEdit 2: The above has been resolved via a maximum size for tags and tooltips that show full tag name.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118876/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118876/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}